{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜结构图\n当前HitImpact接口已同步effect节点与子图；Gate64R1已编译，原解析叶通过，真实BP/媒体/网络未验。\n其它节点保留Build55阶段内容，Host/Input/K3当前产出与待迁移状态以[[计划_实施状态]]为准；仍需后续GAS模块统一图文整理。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|关键调用]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害]] · [[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|命中反馈结构子图]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Input／Hero消费者\nPlayerInput唯一原生Key/Device观察；Hero管自身Action/缓冲，ASC唯一held聚合。\n目标Receive原请求／End原ID／Queue完整Retry；Hero旧Tag未迁移。\n物理原则已授权；混合注入技术方案待选，仅相关线等待。\nPostProcessInput唯一驱动Process。\n[[Input/结构|Input合同]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 持久状态宿主\nSlot/BossState持ASC，Host选择/公布Avatar。\nRequestAvatarBinding→ASC事务→Extension原H→Publish；ActorInfo只归ASC。\nH1：原提交cleanup查询＋显式ClearMode已静态接受冻结。\nH2：原Operation清理已根有限静态接受冻结，原Init失败保留。\nHealth/Base已消费，Hero未接；整链未成功整链编译/UE。\n[[Combatants/结构|Host接口]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\nReceive／End／Queue→原输入ID资源，精确清理；唯一Spec held／queued聚合。\nProcessAbilityInput→有序边沿／每边沿来源冻结／Try一次许可，无第二Tick。\nNotifyAbilityFailed（final）→消费独立Can证明，真实Queued发送完整原Retry。\nIsActivationBlockedByGroup→只读组规则。\nNotifyAbilityActivated→跨实例sequence／预留。\nFinalizeAbilityGroupAdmission→ActiveCount++后裁决pending、取消settled，唯一组登记终检。\nClientCorrectAbilityState→按Spec/实例/key路由，不解释业务载荷。\nActorInfo事务／Busy／发布见下方；本轮新链未成功整链编译。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 570,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 仲裁配置\n`UGGYGOAbilityGroupConfig`：GroupTag → 共存/独占/排队规则。\n`UGGYGOAbilityTagRelationshipMapping`：能力 Tag → 额外要求/阻断/取消 Tag。\n两者由 PawnData 注入 ASC。",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility\nCanActivateAbility（final）→ 原 ActorInfo／GAS-BP／冷却、成本、Tag／组检查；返回前封闭独立评估。\nCanActivateAbilityAdditional → protected const 业务追加条件，不替代核心检查。\nOnAbilityFailedToActivate → NativeOnAbilityFailedToActivate → ScriptOnAbilityFailedToActivate；反馈事件保留。\n保存 ASC 分配的组准入 sequence 栈，与本次输入来源证明分开。\nBuildHitEffectPayload → 统一 Context、可选 Spec、表面/目标 Tag 与 Cue；Origin 由命中回调提供。\nReceiveAbilityCorrection → 派生能力解释载荷。\nGetGroupTag/GetActivationPriority → 仲裁配置。",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "set",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySet\n`GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)` → 按 AttributeSet、GA、GE 顺序授予。\n`GrantedHandles::TakeFromAbilitySystem(ASC)` → 收回这次授予。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "attr",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HealthSet / CombatSet\nHealthSet：Damage/Healing/PoiseDamage 元属性与生命、韧性变更委托。\nCombatSet：BaseDamage/BaseHeal/BasePoiseDamage 供 Execution 捕获。",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "effect",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 伤害 / 表现接口\nDamageExecution::Execute → Origin到HitPoint距离衰减，写目标元属性。\nEffectContext::Duplicate → 保留显式Origin。\nHitImpact::HandleGameplayCue / OnExecute → K2 / Super前Resolve原输入；默认HitResult必需，不自动换Target。BP可显式选参数位置/目标中心。\n已知表面漏配默认拒绝；原点/Overlap合法。\nGameplayCueManager → 加载/分发；接口/配置/生命周期见[[AbilitySystem/Cues/结构|子模块]]与[[GGYGO_结构_HitImpact.canvas|结构子图]]。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1210,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 关键交互契约\nSlot/BossState→AbilitySet::GiveToAbilitySystem→持久ASC；自身Handles精确撤装。\n目标Hero→Receive原Tag/ID/有限绝对deadline；真实Released或Invalidated→End原ID，局部清理不全ASC.Clear。\nProcess→final Can独立评估→final Notify一次消费完整来源→真实Queued完整Retry；目标Hero核原ID再Queue，窗口不延长。\nASC唯一held／queued聚合；Input唯一物理事实；Hero仅自身观测与有限意图。当前Hero和Action观察端口未迁移。\nBoss QueryOnly／raw Try不带玩家输入证明，原Native→Script失败反馈保留。\n命中→BuildHitEffectPayload→GE/Execution/HealthSet；GA仍负责业务生命周期，ASC精确播放归属接口已源码实现；Task原Handle消费已源码接入，GA统一结束及旧夹具／业务源认证未实施。\n历史专项不是本轮编译/资产/网络通过。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1570,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4exec",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一UGGYGOASC｜ActorInfo事务与一次发布\nGetAvatarBindingContext / CheckAvatarBindingContext → 唯一身份读取／核对。\nTryExecuteAvatarActorInfoTransaction → 精确Current正常准入。\nTryBootstrapAvatarActorInfoTransaction → Unissued且完整空Context。\nTryReplaceRevokedAvatarActorInfoTransaction → 精确Revoked显式替换；三者不互为错误兜底。\nIsAvatarBindingNativeWriteBusy → 包住完整Super、返回重检及Commit；窗口内Busy，不排队。\nInvalidateAvatarBinding → 撤工作/匹配发布许可，保留原提交快照仅作cleanup；真实ActorInfo写前退休。\nPublishAvatarBindingNotice(Receipt, Query) → 校验原Proof／Context／实际字段及必需同步纯谓词，一次事件与逐项GA通知。\nIsAvatarBindingNoticeDispatching(Receipt) → 仅精确真实Dispatching；Pending／历史不通过。\nIsAvatarBindingPublicationContextCurrent(Context) → 仅当前Dispatching／成功Consumed，不是全局Ready。\nASC独占一个发布记录与阶段；失败Closed、成功Consumed分开，无第二Avatar／Issuer／历史队列。\n发布不占原生Busy；合法B接续后，A历史bCommitted保留、返回Stale，只清A。\n旧Init／Clear／项目Refresh仍独占原生窗口；基类非虚Refresh绕行不在保障内。\n历史Gate43执行四叶与P1/R1发布专项通过。下方两cleanup来源已实现/静态接受冻结，未成功整链编译；Host H1已消费，H2已有限静态接受冻结，整链/R0未关闭。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 900,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4receipt",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAvatarBindingPublicationReceipt\nTryGetCommittedEvidence(Result, Notice) → 先清输出，只复制历史；true不等于当前绑定／发布／Ready。\nASC唯一创建私有const Proof；保存原Kind、Before弱端点、Result／Notice，复制共享历史资源。\nInit／Refresh描述After；Clear为Released并保留Before，owner-only Init不等同Clear。\nPublish须另核对当前原Proof；历史副本仍可读取，却不能清后继或执行新动作。\nGate43已验证真实历史与失败复位；新的发布契约见左侧ASC和下方事件，Host／Extension已源码消费，整链未成功整链编译。",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4notice",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOAvatarBindingNoticeEvent\nASC持有原生多播的私有封装；仅ASC可Broadcast，外部不能复制或转成可广播基类。\nASC::OnAvatarBindingNotice() → 借用订阅入口。\nAddUObject／AddWeakLambda等 → 原调用方的监听句柄。\nRemove(Handle)／RemoveAll(Object) → 撤自己的监听。\n参数：const Receipt& 与 const Notice&，原历史载荷不当当前权限。\n接收者须查IsAvatarBindingNoticeDispatching并核对自身原资源。\n实际源码消费者：[[Combatants/结构|Host]]的原Dispatching桥接[[Character/结构|Extension]]真实Ready；Health／Base原H消费已编码，Hero未接；新链未成功整链编译。\nP1／R1已编译，发布与PendingRemove两叶通过。",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 2700,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4cancel",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜原归属限定清理\nTryCancelAvatarBindingAbilities(Expected, With, Without, pureQuery)：原Context／业务筛选／原清理资源；null With不筛选，非null空With匹配零，标签栈复制。\nTryRemoveAvatarBindingGameplayCues(Expected, pureQuery)：原清理作用域，不依赖Ready或已撤本地缓存；一次原生Active Tag清理，不承诺全Cue结束。\n二者复用I1/native Busy与MatchCommittedCleanupContext：Query前后/完整返回核原Current或Revoked提交来源，关匹配发布许可后一次Super/Complete；不改Binding/ActorInfo，无Commit/Receipt/Notice。\n失效只退原Operation，不清后继／回滚已发生动作，无第二执行器。\nC1a Gate48真实筛选／Busy／B接续专项通过；C1b已冻结静态接受，Gate49R1已编译／真实Removed与Busy专项通过。[[Combatants/结构|Host]]已源码调用；ASC两来源已冻结/未成功整链编译；Host H1已适配、H2已有限静态接受冻结，整链未成功整链编译/UE。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3260,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ability-input-original-resource-values",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1670,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 700,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 原输入接口／普通值｜已编码\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRequestIdentity：原weak ASC＋InputRevision＋非零RequestSerial；rev0合法，弱身份保持index/serial。\nFGGYGOAbilityInputRetryRequest：InputTag＋Identity＋原World有限绝对OriginalDeadline；默认-1无效。\nReceiveAbilityInputRequest(Tag,PreviousID,Deadline)：空ID签原请求；非空仅复核原资源，冻结首次Spec集合／Owner/Avatar/World。\nEndAbilityInputRequest(ID,Kind)：Released最后来源发释放且保留有限tap；Invalidated退休不伪Released，原义务不借当前Ready。\nQueueAbilityInputRetry(const OriginalRetry&)：完整ID/Tag/deadline＋真实Queued许可，不延长窗口或替held。\nOnAbilityInputRetryable(const OriginalRetry&)：本次Can精确来源，不按Tag找最近请求。\nResult只为Accepted/AlreadyApplied/Rejected/Stale历史，不代表技能激活；这些值不持第二held权威。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#单次 Can 评估与输入失败来源（B0）|完整契约/实现/边界]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-playback-asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜精确原Local播放来源\nTryPlayMontageWithOwnership(GA,Activation,Montage,Rate,Section,Time,pureQuery)：完整Super／Guard后认证源与Local一致，返回单一Result，成功才签Playback。\nCheckMontagePlaybackOwnership(Original)：纯原资源校验，停止／无活动实例不丢清理资格。\nCaptureMontagePlaybackOwnership(原GA,Spec,Activation)：只取已有认证记录；缺失NoOwnedPlayback，不造新Handle。\nTryClearMontageAnimatingAbility(Original)：精确Check后仅基类GA setter／Local清空，退休原记录；不Stop／延迟混出。\n唯一provenance持原ActorInfo快照，不是播放状态／第二执行器。\n实际Init／Clear退休；同端点Refresh无真实变化则保留。原生可截获入口核对，拒绝外层不清后继。\n已源码冻结未成功整链编译；Task已接原Result／Handle，GA统一终止未接。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#精确Montage播放归属（K3：ASC与Task源码冻结，GA未迁移）|完整契约]]",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 860,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-playback-values",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Handle／结果与Animation接缝\nFGGYGOAbilityMontagePlaybackHandle：私有const Proof，仅ASC签发；HasPlayback／HasSamePlayback只读身份。\nProof含原ASC、GA／Spec／ActivationKey、Montage、Guard完整证据与Local计数一致性；8位计数不是唯一身份。\nResult／Check／Clear：Outcome＋Reason＋Guard历史＋原Handle；Failed不补成功资源。\nAnimation Guard唯一提供生命周期／非复用CallId／CreatedInstanceId，ASC认证真实Local写入；Task只持原资源。\n未观察Owner ABA／限定基类绕行不冒称已截获，无网络协议或帧调度。\n[[Animation/结构|Guard接口]] · [[AbilitySystem/计划_AbilitySystem#当前精确Montage增量（K3）|阶段与缺口]]",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 680,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "k3-task-resource-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent\nPlayMontageAndWaitForEvent／ResolvePlayRate → 配置与同次有效速率；BP工厂/委托保持。\nActivate → ASC.TryPlayMontageWithOwnership，纯原Task／ActorInfo查询；成功才存原Handle／Guard并按CreatedInstanceId绑定精确实例委托。\nIsNotifyValid → 原源／精确实例播放＋ASC.Check原Handle才接GameplayEvent；先复制负载再广播。\nOnMontageBlendingOutForInstance → 释放自身缩放，TryClear原Handle；A不借同GA/资产清B。\nOnMontageEndedForInstance → 原Guard＋原上下文＋AbilityTask资格，非打断发布Completed事实；不Check已退休当前归属，不授后继GA End权限。\nExternalCancel／OnDestroy → 自身监听/委托/缩放lease；栈共持停止义务，外调已结束不再安装。\n停止只按原Guard实例；精确ASC认证＋活动ID才CurrentMontageStop，否则仅原本地资源释放，不改新ASC/GA。\n无全局尝试表／token／新实例扫描，无第二播放状态。\n源码静态接受冻结，未成功整链编译／UE；GA终止、旧夹具／业务源认证及资产网络仍开放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#Task原实例与资源消费（源码已接，未编译）|接口/实现/清理]] · [[Animation/结构|Guard职责]]",
      "x": 3500,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 860,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-committed-cleanup-source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜已提交cleanup来源\nCheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext(Expected, OutReason) const → 纯GT认证原Issuer/Context/LastWrite、ActorInfo allocation与完整快照；Current或Revoked，不执行/签发/Ready。\n单个AvatarBindingActorInfoSnapshot：逻辑撤销保留cleanup；真实typed/legacy写前退休，同端点也不续权。\nWorkingBinding仍Current/live；CommittedCleanup允许仍合法分配且Destroy中的原Owner/Avatar，无效ASC/字段变化明确失败。\nCancel/Cue/Clear消费同一来源/原native窗口；关闭Owner或宿主PreserveOwner→LifecycleClosed，调用方显式ClearActorInfo，不失败后换模式。\nTyped Clear沿既有提交/Released契约；query本身不发布。\nfinite_static_accepted_uncompiled。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原已提交清理来源（Destroy）|来源/失效/模式]]",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 3260,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-failed-init-cleanup-proof",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一ASC｜未commit Init原写入证明\n私有const FFailedAvatarActorInfoInitCleanupProof持OriginalOperation、Before、完整WrittenActual；原allocation防复用，Actor弱引用，不存caller闭包。\n普通/Bootstrap/Replace的native Init完整返回后捕获；未commit失败且原场景仍匹配才保留，成功commit不保留。\nTryCleanupFailedAvatarActorInfoInit(原Operation, pureOriginalCallerQuery) → 核成员原Proof/Before/allocation/全字段，query在既有Busy内前后重检。\n先消费Proof再唯一qualified Super::ClearActorInfo；核真实清空后置条件，raw AnimInstance/Tag按GAS保留。\nSucceeded只为物理cleanup，bCommitted=false、Context空，无Receipt/Notice/Ready；原Init仍失败，native后失败不重发Proof。\n后继真实typed/legacy写、消费或ASC销毁释放；无第二绑定/序号/队列/执行器。\nfinite_static_accepted_uncompiled。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#失败Init原写入清理（未提交证明）|来源/消费/后置条件]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4080,
      "width": 730,
      "height": 790,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4-cleanup-host-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 清理调用方｜Host消费接缝\n[[Combatants/结构|CombatantState]]持自己的选择/H/请求作用域，ASC独占写入与证明，[[Character/结构|Extension]]独占本地通知资源。\nH1已静态接受冻结：原提交清理用CheckAvatarBindingCleanupContext，不以Ready/新装配检查阻挡Closing；Release和已提交失败收尾显式选ClearMode。\nH2已根有限静态接受冻结：Init/owner-only失败分支消费原Operation＋pure原scope，原Init仍失败；边上“未验收”为N2阶段标签。\n清理scope与初始化工作scope分开；不查后继Context借权，不回滚失败或自动重试。\nBuild55整链编译失败/未UE；三项机械修正已冻结、Hero旧三调用未迁移，不扩严格矩阵。R0/K3/GA及资产网络边界保留。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#清理调用方与本轮验证边界|消费/验证门禁]]",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 4080,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 750,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "input",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "asc",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "提交输入或语义激活请求"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
